      <h1 class="jr-h1">Knee Osteoarthritis Grades: What Does Grade 2 Actually Mean?</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">A radiology report comes back with a number on it, and the number is what people remember long after the consultation. This is what each grade describes, how loosely it tracks the pain you feel, and how often a grade 2 knee actually gets worse.</p>

